  "display_title": "I Became the Dying Female Lead's Sister",
  "description": "In a twist of fate, a girl wakes up as Lynzelle, twin to her favorite novel's dying female lead, Lykke. To secure Lykke's happiness, she volunteers to wed the fearsome prince, Hernan, in her sister's stead. But hold on... The scary prince turns out to be super cute, sparking unforeseen feelings! Everything seems perfect until Lynzelle's health mysteriously deteriorates more than Lykke's, and the story takes an unexpected turn. Is this cute twin tale hiding more secrets than meets the eye? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
